[{"title":"感怀效渊明体","author":"姜特立","text":"人生百年中，长为子孙忧。\n人生百年后，死生两悠悠。\n流传至曾玄，恩爱竟何许。\n孤坟千万祀，莫适谁为主。\n嗟哉世间人，小黠而大痴。\n惜衣仍忍寒，省口仍忍饥。\n一朝大化尽，未免世俗嗤。\n存者且偷生，逝者归无期。\n眼前一樽酒，劝君且重持。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38155,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"感戚夫人事","author":"姜特立","text":"女以色而死，士以才而亡。\n处才不才间，此语最深长。\n我昔愚自信，遭逐方悲伤。\n投迹归山林，为乐特未央。\n失马反为福，始悟得不偿。\n向来尤其人，今乃佩恩光。\n忮心成美意，陷阱为康庄。\n寄语斯鞅辈，善刀宜早藏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38156,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"暇日叹日月之逾迈念吾生之几何感而成章","author":"姜特立","text":"密移不自觉，猛省却堪惊。\n红颜去不返，白发来无情。\n劫秦气何用，袒汉力莫争。\n求胜竟无术，陶然任此生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38157,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"满公临老种松志可尚也梅山老人为说小偈","author":"姜特立","text":"满公种松何太痴，急景尚作千年期。\n安得雷风一夜拔千尺，与汝同看龙蛇舞月时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38158,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"罨菜","author":"姜特立","text":"梅山罨菜胜羹藜，怪见宾筵玉箸齐。\n大似雪堂真一酒，绝胜金谷韭蓱齑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38159,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"鹏鴳问答","author":"姜特立","text":"吾闻北冥鹏，翼若垂天云。\n矫首扶桑汜，投趾昆崙垠。\n渴饮黄河流，饥食紫渊鳞。\n长翮盈千车，短羽重万钧。\n去以六月息，栖止良苦辛。\n黑风忽翻海，未易容其身。\n偶与斥鴳遇，问鴳有何乐。\n鴳云我幺禽，岂暇议寥廓。\n为生诚甚微，为计亦易足。\n吸以棘针露，分以鹪鹩粟。\n决起枪榆间，却向蓬蒿落。\n不睎九万程，只愿一枝托。\n鹏听鴳所云，似若生羡慕。\n彼小乃有馀，我大适为苦。\n呼鴳问所安，鴳笑而不语。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38160,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"暮年即事","author":"姜特立","text":"八十衰翁如小儿，爱餐梨栗作儿嬉。\n有时淡饮三杯酒，无事閒吟两首诗。\n还丹却老吾不知，头童齿豁一听之。\n但愿造物相扶持，寿考或可登期颐。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38161,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"蜡梅","author":"姜特立","text":"百花结成蜡，花香蜡不香。\n如何此枝上，似蜡更芬芳。\n意彼百花魂，结聚无所发。\n英灵为此花，色香相假合。\n虞姬死为草，舞动应乐节。\n蜀主化杜鹃，啼染枝头血。\n轮回有托化，亦闻金仙说。\n花月自有妖，未易以理察。\n乌知此花魂，为香不为蜡。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38162,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"潘德久永嘉佳士也闻其能诗久矣而不我过仆一日以小诗挑之遂携古风见访次韵奉答","author":"姜特立","text":"闻名渴见面，未合长相思。\n纷纷数来人，谁契此心期。\n识公恨不早，委刺方嫌迟。\n正欲我辈人，共此一段奇。\n良贾虽深藏，有宝人得知。\n被褐既怀玉，脱囊可无锥。\n聊将一缕麻，换此五色丝。\n曲意相假借，仁衷恕嘲嗤。\n子怀谅已伸，我惭亦自贻。\n此道久凋丧，相从当在兹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38163,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠染髭宋道人","author":"姜特立","text":"道人染髭须，返老作年少。\n虽得陆公怜，却被吕公笑。\n道人尔休痴，百年终漏逗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38164,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠曾少卿","author":"姜特立","text":"我诵茶山诗，不识茶山面。\n今朝逢嫡孙，论诗得关键。\n李杜不再传，苏黄才一见。\n茶山子有孙，夜光同一串。\n故家妙人物，笔底波澜健。\n何当直两锋，看取空中箭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38165,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"骤寒拥炉","author":"姜特立","text":"雪霰晓漫漫，天公剩作寒。\n林梢栖白凤，炉焰舞红鸾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38166,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"书寿穴中石寿星背四言","author":"姜特立","text":"彼石何人，云是寿者。\n作镇斯宫，孰分真假。\n以幻对幻，有同儿嬉。\n他日启扃，问尔是谁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38167,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山中","author":"姜特立","text":"篱畔黄花翠竹，雨后青山白云。\n此是山中活计，莫教俗士知闻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38168,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"元宵小饮游人填塞殊可厌","author":"姜特立","text":"一灯何似千灯，千灯争如一月。\n虽云屋下荧煌，不若空中皎洁。\n笙歌万井喧哗，车马九衢填咽。\n老子静对婵娟，自是一般奇绝。\n混沌灯意略同，矫俗救奢良诀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38169,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"六言","author":"姜特立","text":"康乐寻山伐木，子猷爱竹叩门。\n我已烟霞痼疾，每逢佳处开樽。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38170,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"石盆水窠","author":"姜特立","text":"数叶玉簪敷翠，一拳水石含秋。\n何须坐我濠濮，自觉心清境幽。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38171,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"纪恩诗","author":"姜特立","text":"百首清诗夜上，九重温诏晨颁。\n自古封侯赐璧，慷慨只立谈间。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38172,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"余行年七十有七腰围顿减殆不胜衣齿亦摇脱可念也","author":"姜特立","text":"衰鬓已凋潘岳，便腹顿减边韶。\n陋姝何必丰脸，烂饭须要长腰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38173,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"閒赋","author":"姜特立","text":"楼台百万装成，花木四时罗列。\n从渠眼底江山，欠我诗中风月。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38174,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"庚申度夏自适","author":"姜特立","text":"透脱逍遥游外，远离烦恼浊中。\n夜夜满怀明月，时时入梦清风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38175,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"扃岫为张支使作二首 其二","author":"姜特立","text":"老去林泉属我，时来轩冕输君。\n正好南冥运翼，未用北山移文。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38176,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"扃岫为张支使作二首 其一","author":"姜特立","text":"士衡招隐翠幄，长统卜居露帏。\n未若君家扃岫，千峰尽锁双扉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38177,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送客","author":"姜特立","text":"今日出郊送客，明朝肩舆入州。\n六十年前伎俩，白头也合归休。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38178,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"卜算子 用坡仙韵","author":"姜特立","text":"丹桂一枝芳，陡觉秋容静。\n月里人间总一般，共此扶疏影。\n枕畔忽闻香，夜半还思省。\n争奈姮娥不嫁人，寂寞孤衾冷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38179,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"西江月 戊午生朝","author":"姜特立","text":"富贵从来自有，人生最羡长年。\n骎骎八秩未华颠。\n更喜此身强健。\n金印新来如斗，丝纶御墨犹鲜。\n枣如瓜大藕如船。\n莫惜尊前满劝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38180,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"阮郎归 寄人","author":"姜特立","text":"绿阴庭院记年时。\n家人捧寿卮。\n乐声催拍送腰支。\n香风匝地衣。\n清梦断，彩云飞。\n刘郎今鬓丝。\n强将杯酒破愁眉。\n如今触事非。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38181,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"声声慢 岩桂","author":"姜特立","text":"云迷越岫，枫冷吴江，天香忽到人寰。\n满额涂黄，别更一种施丹。\n天教素秋独步，笑同时、霜菊秋兰。\n最好处，向水阶月地，把酒相看。\n应有骚人雅韵，将胆瓶筠管，簇向屏山。\n野店云房，争待结屋中间。\n无奈猖狂老子，架巢卧、风露清闲。\n待早晚，约姮娥、同住广寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38182,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"念奴娇 庚申生朝","author":"姜特立","text":"宦途巇险，问急流勇退，几人闻早。\n自别修门今正是，一纪生朝还到。\n绿野风光，平泉草木，争似梅山好。\n园林如画，芰荷香泛芳沼。\n早晚玉节来临，君恩踵至，金印应如斗。\n好是华堂开宴处，歌舞管弦声奏。\n海上蟠桃，山中仙杏，共劝长生酒。\n莫辞沈醉，年年此会依旧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38183,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"画堂春","author":"姜特立","text":"故园二月正芳菲。\n红紫团枝。\n一番草绿谢郎池。\n人醉如泥。\n底事江乡风物，年年独殿芳时。\n无情燕子背人飞。\n似愧春迟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38184,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"临江仙","author":"姜特立","text":"桃李飞花春渐老，海棠次第芬芳。\n庭前红药已成行。\n酴醾开未到，犹更有花王。\n从此便须排日醉，莫将闲事相妨。\n老来不是太疏狂。\n尊前君看取，潘鬓已成霜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38185,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋夜月","author":"姜特立","text":"新月秀弯弯，高悬碧落间。\n何当依玉户，潇洒看江山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38186,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋霁","author":"姜特立","text":"清秋初过雨，湿叶闪晴晖。\n数册文书静，一庭人事稀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38187,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"浣溪沙","author":"姜特立","text":"节序回环已献裘。\n不堪风叶夜鸣秋。\n寒螀吟露月阶幽。\n蜗角虚名真误我，蝇头细字不禁愁。\n班超何日定封侯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38188,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"浪淘沙令","author":"姜特立","text":"春事有来期。\n且喜春归。\n问春何似去年时。\n报道今年春意好，随分开眉。\n往事莫伤悲。\n光景如飞。\n十分潘鬓已成丝。\n幸是风流犹未减，且醉芳菲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38189,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"菩萨蛮 其三 中秋不见月","author":"姜特立","text":"镜天良月皆佳节。\n休恨今宵妨皎洁。\n玉锁閟蟾宫。\n姮娥意自通。\n终有开时节。\n莫放笙歌歇。\n来夕尚婵娟。\n何妨把酒看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38190,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"菩萨蛮 其二","author":"姜特立","text":"蓬山学士文章伯。\n尊前风味谁能敌。\n新觅似花人。\n添成小院春。\n玉纤呵翠袖。\n满劝金杯酒。\n寿酒莫辞斟。\n酒深人意深。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38191,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"菩萨蛮 其一","author":"姜特立","text":"日长庭院无人到。\n琅玕翠影摇寒甃。\n困卧北窗凉。\n好风吹梦长。\n璧月升东岭。\n冷浸扶疏影。\n苗叶万珠明。\n露华圆更清。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38192,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"朝中措 其二 送人","author":"姜特立","text":"十分天赋好精神。\n宫样小腰身。\n迷却阳城下蔡，未饶宋玉东邻。\n不堪回首，高唐去梦，楚峡归云。\n从此好寻夫婿，有书频寄鸿鳞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38193,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"朝中措 其一 应令锦林檎","author":"姜特立","text":"芳林曲径锦玲珑。\n腻白借微红。\n元是海棠标格，司花点化东风。\n端相浑似，玉真未醉，春思先慵。\n留取浅颦低笑，夜深翠幄轻笼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38194,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"朝中措 其三 和欧阳公韵","author":"姜特立","text":"如山堂上翠横空。\n山影浪花中。\n夜夜林间明月，时时柳外清风。\n如今到此，翛然万事，无处情钟。\n唯有尊前一笑，分明好个山翁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38195,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"感皇恩 壬戌生朝","author":"姜特立","text":"儿女沸欢声，生朝来到。\n帘幕中间喷香兽。\n京祠新任，好事日边还又。\n清闲无个事，君恩厚。\n赢得乞食，歌姬一笑。\n旧衲云山伴红袖。\n蓬莱弱水，试问神仙何有。\n近来饶落托，贪杯酒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38196,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"满江红 己未生朝","author":"姜特立","text":"听说梅山，一邱内、深藏曲折。\n过醒心桥下，水光清彻。\n迤逦跻攀登翠岭，沈沈烟壑千峰列。\n更小亭、风露逼华堂，荷香发。\n歌声动，云横阙。\n舞腰转，风回雪。\n正良辰美景，众宾欢悦。\n老子中间聊笑傲，酒行莫放觥筹歇。\n愿此生、长似钓璜公，添华发。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38197,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"满江红 辛酉生朝","author":"姜特立","text":"小小华堂，朱阑外、乱山如簇。\n更云中仙掌，一峰高矗。\n南极老人呈瑞处，丙丁躔次光相烛。\n又谁知、堂上有闲人，无拘束。\n宾朋至，须歌曲。\n风月好，纷丝竹，都不管、世间是非荣辱。\n屈指如今侪辈少，几人老后能知足。\n问此身、何地寄生涯，唯松菊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38198,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"满庭芳 寿曾两府","author":"姜特立","text":"丹染吴枫，青环越岫，镜天霁色凝鲜。\n华堂珊佩，非务拥神仙。\n天遣澄清海岳，亲曾授黄石奇编。\n兴王略，智名俱泯，功业妙难言。\n翩翩。\n真迥立，香飘绣衮，色映貂蝉。\n有清诗千首，美酒如川。\n长与嫦娥共约，放冰轮，今夕先圆。\n中秋月，从今屈指，更借一千年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38199,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"蝶恋花 送妓","author":"姜特立","text":"飘粉吹香三月暮。\n病酒情怀，愁绪浑无数。\n有个人人来又去。\n归期有恨难留驻。\n明日尊前无觅处。\n咿轧篮舆，只向双溪路。\n我辈情钟君谩与。\n为云为雨应难据。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38200,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"霜天晓角 为夜游湖作","author":"姜特立","text":"欢娱电掣。\n何况轻离别。\n料得两情无奈，思量尽、总难说。\n酒热。\n凄兴发。\n共寻波底月。\n长结西湖心愿，水有尽、情无歇。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38201,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋江渔乐图为邑人宗正纯撰","author":"姜德明","text":"枫树萧萧霜叶红，芦花瑟瑟鸣西风。\n渔翁举网秋江上，轻舟一叶波溶溶。\n群鱼游泳影相续，密网收来心易足。\n赤鳞素质影跳空，玉尺金梭光炫目。\n鼓枻归来日未斜，腥风吹入比邻家。\n家人出户欢相迓，笑举鱼筐还自誇。\n老妻汲泉向江口，稚子攀条折杨柳。\n汲泉炊水待烹鳞，贯柳携鱼去沽酒。\n黄昏灯火罗盘餐，妻儿笑语娱团栾。\n况值时清少徵税，一生未解愁饥寒。\n却笑商人轻远别，寒帐孤眠怨妻妾。\n更怜农父在西畴，年丰则喜荒则忧。\n何如渔者生涯寄江水，取之无穷用不已。\n朝复暮兮醉复醒，长年啸傲烟波里。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38202,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"剑门关","author":"姜遵","text":"极目双峰剑倚天，重门因设据高山。\n城隍尽枕溪岩畔，井邑全居水石间。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38203,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"书姜白石昔游诗后","author":"韩淲","text":"平生未踏洞庭野，亦不曾登南岳峰。\n因君谈旧游，恍如常相从。\n江淮历历转湘浦，裘马意气传边烽。\n吾尝汎大江，祇见匡庐松。\n乘风醉卧帆影底，高浪直溅岚光浓。\n日暮泊船时，是时方严冬。\n雪花压船船背重，缆摇舵鼓声如钟。\n当年意浅语不到，无句可写波涛舂。\n君诗乃如许，景物不易供。\n尽归一毫端，状出三飞龙。\n人间胜处贵著眼，虽有此兴无由逢。\n钱唐山水亦自好，奈何薄宦难从容。\n南高北高一千丈，潮头日夜鸣灵踪。\n应有隐者为识赏，青鞋布袜扶杖筇。\n君无诧彼我愧此，急还诗卷心徒忪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38204,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"以“长歌意无极，好为老夫听”为韵奉别沔鄂亲友十首 其一","author":"姜夔","text":"滔滔沔鄂留，有腼三宿桑。\n持钵了白日，事贱丸蛣蜣。\n念当去石友，烟席凌江湘。\n为君试歌商，歌短意则长。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38205,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"以“长歌意无极，好为老夫听”为韵奉别沔鄂亲友十首 其二","author":"姜夔","text":"佳人鲁山下，日弄清汉波。\n促弦调宝瑟，哀思感人多。\n咬哇秦缶击，冷落郢客歌。\n知音良不易，如此粲者何。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38206,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"以“长歌意无极，好为老夫听”为韵奉别沔鄂亲友十首 其三","author":"姜夔","text":"英英白龙孙，眉目古人气。\n拮据营数椽，下帘草生砌。\n文章作径庭，功用见造次。\n无庸垂罄嗟，遗安鹿门意。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38207,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"以“长歌意无极，好为老夫听”为韵奉别沔鄂亲友十首 其四","author":"姜夔","text":"诗人辛国士，句法似阿驹。\n别墅沧浪曲，绿阴禽鸟呼。\n颇参金粟眼，渐造文字无。\n儿辈例学语，屋壁祝蒲卢。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38208,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"以“长歌意无极，好为老夫听”为韵奉别沔鄂亲友十首 其五","author":"姜夔","text":"山阴千载人，挥洒照八极。\n只今定武刻，犹带龙虎笔。\n单侯出机杼，岂是剑舞得。\n馀波入竹石，绝叹咄咄逼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38209,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"以“长歌意无极，好为老夫听”为韵奉别沔鄂亲友十首 其六","author":"姜夔","text":"异时之罘君，在涅守白颢。\n黄钟欠牛铎，淋漓吊遗稿。\n有子殊可人，特未见此老。\n客来请论文，但道曲肱好。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38210,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"以“长歌意无极，好为老夫听”为韵奉别沔鄂亲友十首 其七","author":"姜夔","text":"中郎游千霜，曲高复谁为。\n庞翁趣无弦，郑伯功斲鼻。\n春风桃花溪，寒渌绕苍翠。\n何当从两君，放浪计幽事。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38211,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"以“长歌意无极，好为老夫听”为韵奉别沔鄂亲友十首 其八","author":"姜夔","text":"宦达羞故妻，贫贱厌丘嫂。\n上书云雨迥，还舍笋蕨老。\n江皋锄带经，决计恨不早。\n士无五羖皮，没世抱枯槁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38212,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"以“长歌意无极，好为老夫听”为韵奉别沔鄂亲友十首 其九","author":"姜夔","text":"伐木响虚牝，吾愿友褐夫。\n九关呀虎豹，何时内高袪。\n黄鹄眇云树，鹦鹉澹烟芜。\n倚杖得清赏，洗心观本初。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38213,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"以“长歌意无极，好为老夫听”为韵奉别沔鄂亲友十首 其十","author":"姜夔","text":"孤鸿度关山，风霜催翅翎。\n影低白云暮，哀噭那忍听。\n士生有如此，储粟不满瓶。\n著书穷愁滨，可续离骚经。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38214,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赤松图","author":"姜夔","text":"山东隆准公，未语心已解。\n按剑堂下人，成事汝应退。\n非无带砺约，政尔有恩害。\n平生三寸舌，松间漱寒濑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38215,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"虞美人草","author":"姜夔","text":"夜阑浩歌起，玉帐生悲风。\n江东可千里，弃妾蓬蒿中。\n化石那解语，作草犹可舞。\n陌上望骓来，翻愁不相顾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38216,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}}]